{
  "name": "Queue one vertical video to YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels and TikTok after a rules check",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## One vertical video to Shorts, Reels and TikTok\n\nFor creators and social teams who post the same short video on three networks and want it checked against all three before anything is uploaded to them.\n\n### How it works\n1. You upload a video, a caption and a YouTube title through an n8n form.\n2. The video goes to Preflight, which measures it: length, size, frame rate, aspect ratio.\n3. Preflight checks the video and caption against YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels and TikTok rules.\n4. If all three accept it, it is queued for each channel's next free slot. The form shows the result, or the exact reasons it was refused.\n\n### Setup\n1. Needs the verified community node **Preflight** ([n8n-nodes-preflight](https://www.npmjs.com/package/n8n-nodes-preflight) 0.1.1 or later): search for Preflight in the nodes panel and choose Install. Tested on n8n 2.43.\n2. In [Preflight](https://preflight.social) (the free plan works), connect your social accounts, then create an API key under Settings → API keys with the scopes `posts:read`, `posts:write`, `posts:publish`, `media:read` and `media:write`. Add it as a **Preflight API** credential in the three Preflight nodes.\n3. Add a Basic Auth credential to **Upload form**, so only people with the login can queue videos.\n4. In **Configuration**, list the channels, e.g. `youtube, instagram, tiktok`.\n\n### Customization\n- TikTok goes to the creator's inbox as **Only me** to finish in the app. Change the TikTok options in both Preflight post nodes when you are ready to post directly.\n- Swap the form for a Google Drive or Dropbox trigger. Cut clips yourself: downloading from YouTube is against its terms.",
        "height": 960,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "8f0dc624-a7dc-5074-b5c1-7c2c302f71a4",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -800,
        -440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Form and upload\nThe video is uploaded in parts and measured before any network sees it.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 740,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "41fe3d07-45dd-5908-bac7-17544257acf2",
      "name": "Section: upload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Check all three networks, then queue\nThe idempotency key is the media ID, so submitting twice does not queue twice.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 1180,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "5263ef61-7903-5b18-9d41-2c1ffaf8f359",
      "name": "Section: check and queue",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "New short video",
        "formDescription": "Checked by Preflight, then queued to YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels and TikTok.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Video",
              "fieldType": "file",
              "multipleFiles": false,
              "acceptFileTypes": ".mp4, .mov",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Caption",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "YouTube title",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "authentication": "basicAuth",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "36f7614f-36fc-55ed-988b-da55de85f6bd",
      "name": "Upload form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "053e174e-0def-591c-9dc3-175981932e34"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "71c28f90-7122-5e75-a816-e35132c9e76f",
              "name": "channels",
              "value": "youtube, instagram, tiktok",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {},
        "includeOtherFields": true
      },
      "id": "28ef3e86-a72b-57a7-9dbd-40bd85b86e5d",
      "name": "Configuration",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "media",
        "operation": "upload",
        "source": "binary",
        "binaryPropertyName": "Video",
        "kind": "video",
        "waitUntilReady": true,
        "options": {
          "waitTimeout": 900
        }
      },
      "id": "702b7cc8-857e-5c56-b3df-727f13a61460",
      "name": "Upload video to Preflight",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-preflight.preflight",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "post",
        "operation": "validate",
        "channels": "={{ $('Configuration').first().json.channels }}",
        "content": "={{ $('Upload form').item.json.Caption }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "mediaIds": "={{ $('Upload video to Preflight').item.json.id }}"
        },
        "networkOptions": {
          "youtubeTitle": "={{ $('Upload form').item.json['YouTube title'] }}",
          "youtubeShort": true,
          "youtubePrivacy": "public",
          "instagramPlacement": "reel",
          "tiktokPrivacy": "SELF_ONLY",
          "tiktokAsDraft": true
        }
      },
      "id": "a795335f-9085-5ca5-aff0-764c79730b59",
